  "idea": "How to compress massive PDF files so they can be emailed easily",
  "text": "This free tool cuts massive PDF file sizes by eighty percent without losing visual quality. Trying to send scanned tax records or portfolio files often triggers immediate mailbox rejection messages. Generic export presets pack uncompressed image layers into your document, ballooning standard files past email limits. Run your document through iLovePDF or Adobe Compressor to strip redundant metadata and downsample images cleanly. You will send lightweight files in seconds.",
